WEBVTT

00:00:00.112 --> 00:00:07.408
This video shows how an admin checks the exam results and announces them to students and parents, on a phone.

00:00:09.082 --> 00:00:14.602
Tap the menu button at the top left, open Academics, and then choose Results.

00:00:17.789 --> 00:00:29.189
Choose the class, and then the exam. At the top the page counts the students who passed and failed, and each student has a card with the marks, the percentage and the grade.

00:00:32.043 --> 00:00:39.243
Scroll through the cards and check the marks and the grades. Check everything carefully before you announce.

00:00:44.910 --> 00:00:53.502
Results are announced from the Exams page. Open Exams, and then tap the Mid-Term 2026 group to open it.

00:00:54.131 --> 00:01:04.619
Tap Announce Results, and tap Announce Results again in the confirmation. The exam now shows its results as announced, and students and parents can see them.

00:01:08.130 --> 00:01:10.554
The results are announced.
